SOAPBOX: First license 05-2024
SOAPBOX: First licensed in 05-2024. It's my first time using my own callsign to participate whole contest in the field. I built my station with a portable YAGI at 8mH and an inverted-V DP on top of a mountain, trying to break the BY rookie record. The propagation seemed very good during the contest but strong wind stopped my operation and eventually broke my YAGI and tripod, I used the ATU for remaining time and failed to break the record. Anyway, it was a nice contest and I enjoyed it!
